2026-10-20T21:06:14.7028252Z                 '## Example\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7029183Z +               'In the example, the function name `spam` has been misspelled in the `__all__` list. This will result in `spamm` being highlighted as an undefined export. Correcting the spelling will fix the defect.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7030169Z -               'In the `check_state1` function, the developer probably did intend to use an implicit return value of `None` as this equates to `False`. However, the function in `check_state2` is easier to read.\n' +
