2026-10-20T21:06:14.7126104Z +               '    def load_and_run(self, filename):\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7126293Z +               '        source = self.load(filename)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7126673Z +               '        self.run(source) # Matches signature in derived class, but not in this class.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7126773Z -               'try:\n' +
