2026-10-20T21:06:14.7229767Z -               'The first line, `++x`, has no effect as it applies the unary plus operator twice. Probably the programmer intended `x += 1`\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7229925Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7230356Z -               'The second line, `x.show`, has no observable effect, but it is likely that `x.show()` was intended.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7230450Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7230543Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7230670Z -               '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7230759Z -               '\n' +
