2026-10-20T21:06:14.7236663Z             fullDescription: {
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7237017Z +             text: 'Explicitly returning a value from an `__init__` method will raise a TypeError.'
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7237515Z -             text: 'Redefining a variable in an inner loop and then using the variable in an outer loop causes unexpected behavior.'
