2026-10-20T21:06:14.7288031Z +               '* Wikipedia: [Liskov Substitution Principle](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liskov_substitution_principle), [Method overriding](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Method_overriding#Python).\n',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7288329Z +             text: '# Mismatch between signature and use of an overriding method\n' +
