2026-10-20T21:06:14.7445866Z                 '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7446784Z +               'Ensure that the `__iter__` method returns `self`, or is otherwise equivalent as an iterator to `self`.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7448979Z -               'Deleting the unreachable code will make the code clearer and preserve the meaning of the code. However, it is possible that the original intention was that the code should execute and that it is unreachable signifies some other error.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7449204Z                 '\n' +
