2026-10-20T21:06:14.7706769Z +             markdown: "# First parameter of a class method is not named 'cls'\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7707795Z +               'The first parameter of a class method (including certain special methods such as `__new__`), or a method of a metaclass, should be named `cls`.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7708170Z -             markdown: '# Redundant assignment\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7708867Z -               'Assigning a variable to itself is redundant and often an indication of a mistake in the code.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7709000Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7709126Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7709323Z                 '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7710142Z +               'Ensure that the first parameter of class methods is named `cls`, as recommended by the style guidelines in PEP 8.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7711061Z -               'Check the assignment carefully for mistakes. If the assignment is truly redundant and not simply incorrect then remove it.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7711194Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7711313Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7711486Z                 '## Example\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7712390Z +               'In the following example, the first parameter of the class method `make` is named `self` instead of `cls`.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7713082Z -               'In this example the programmer clearly intends to assign to `self.eggs` but made a mistake.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7713310Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7713443Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7713606Z                 '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7714054Z +               'class Entry(object):\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7714283Z +               '    @classmethod\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7714516Z +               '    def make(self):\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7714752Z +               '        return Entry()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7714948Z -               'class Spam:\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7715080Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7715341Z -               '    def __init__(self, eggs):\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7715555Z -               '        eggs = eggs\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7715700Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7715843Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7715983Z                 '```\n' +
