2026-10-20T21:06:14.7938728Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7939018Z +               'In these examples `KeyboardInterrupt` is accidentally ignored.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7939104Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7939197Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7939372Z                 '```python\n' +
