2026-10-20T21:06:14.7956506Z +             markdown: '# Empty except\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.7958242Z +               'Ignoring exceptions that should be dealt with in some way is almost always a bad idea. The loss of information can lead to hard to debug errors and incomplete log files. It is even possible that ignoring an exception can cause a security vulnerability. An empty `except` block may be an indication that the programmer intended to handle the exception, but never wrote the code to do so.\n' +
